{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【香港成人展MFE】原定11月13日在香港富豪機場酒店、香港首個成人展「MEGA FANS EXPO 2026（MFE）」今日突然傳出取消消息。根據多位參展日本AV女優，包括波多野結衣、宮下玲奈、青空光、大槻響等人的「X（前稱「Twitter」）」及私訊截圖，指她們在抵達香港後遭到拒絕入境。</p><p>根據《香港01》消息，主辦方亞洲娛樂集團（AEE Group Limited）確認活動取消，詳情將會稍後發稿交代。官方訂購平台Kkday亦宣布，活動會取消，訂單會安排全額退款。</p><p>事件引來網民熱議，有人揶揄「又話盛事之都？笑話之都咋？」、「香港搞乜都死……」、「盛事經濟？」不過亦有網民認為活動取消並不意外，「始終呢啲活動涉及色情行為港府一向都唔鼓勵，係咪今次有人搞得太高調？」。</p><p>入境處回覆《香港01》查詢指，活動相關人士在獲悉活動取消後選擇離港，而並非遭拒絕入境，傳聞內容並非屬實。</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197261742091014144206413.jpeg/f1y2dRlgn1v7M6RuY-agx0m9iyRPu5ADckQ5mXJEOZk\"/><p>香港成人展MFE嘉賓名單：青空光、明里紬、淺野心、伊藤舞雪、大槻響、小野六花、楓富愛、金松季步、神木麗、河北彩花、紗倉真菜、櫻空桃、涼森玲夢、瀨戶環奈、田野憂、七嶋舞、七森莉莉、西宮夢、雛乃花音、本庄鈴、美園和花、MINAMO、宮下玲奈、惠理、八掛海、彌生美月、楪可憐、吉高寧寧。</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197227278799474688287140.png/QC1AGRpNGXTLfns_HaJTVOCY-ES6jZaE-6MfAfujHwE\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197227281538486272674935.png/WWC1b1fCmFkHQSFyh6djhHXMGQsXhAWHoxgFxaMYBcU\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197227284051005440629750.png/tk-1OsbnkGVHjueTAxvhrE3B6eqLhkIY1PcgRtT3IEY\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197227286676770816378601.png/-JLZquv04b4c3Ta8Af6g8VR3QKKRJnSws573I7Oe9yM\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197227289361256448204387.png/pEJkkm0ZU04z4_ZQFL9bYsutucqXCYcTXInKQVyJykE\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197227278761725952895710.png/d8FJdMD5PV4VZMlC6fdEDGV0ODBgqbpnylRGNspURjY\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197227281303605248106328.png/wl-ZMiUreNSYxu-oopP5jF8_XUIrwNMDQeH5j0Hh-Y8\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197227283832901632642913.png/659eCPxNFSoSrvAgPNxkfYsCv7AG8ioht7hifre4Yn4\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197227286500610048385214.png/DnNayObQLqIWihR0yoPbZoVgoXnMORQ1n02yhZ9NsoU\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197227288941826048305176.png/8MOPQHaTd5pAqogaGLsUrvknJy-d7JSnRchf6kXIX-o\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197227277918670848751423.png/AhpGryER4by4G8KJHoSMGQvD_yYFOJnXQRe5-0EXufs\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197227280565407744410956.png/56Bo8Tz7_YcOpCr-t4YjzsFFG2xF2h7mlvQ7kJb0O5A\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197227283124064256748621.png/SIxX4_CHOuGa3Bv70TM6q-k9oO4QK2jtz6mZQM-pmUA\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197227285603028992679258.png/c1M_Roid2MkHEXygB6RjUj40rtUXxHwD_ga_Zv4Gv2Y\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197227287838724096317509.png/gGROw6HBxLGSUtLEum4ySzdecqUFTAsdzeu2d83rtnc\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197227272143114240731846.png/yuDbaQlfYV-ylNcOyNK65DTsDe3tbKRKfOKmUXziplE\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197227274894708736149753.png/6Jz2vH0fvt5i1z6sowjC9tZxg570doSqjLeHvIy3h7w\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197227277981847552897563.png/ThvBOvZI1tT8HKAeGpxkn0ys0qMuzUfPsaEu9LGhLvQ\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197227280465006592678932.png/zegxodhFyUkS3PuhDjS0xTcnCWwlMYlCRKaWokSmlqI\"/><p>根據香港現行法例，外籍人士若來港參與商業演出、粉絲見面會或提供任何受薪/非受薪服務，均須預先向香港入境處申請合適的工作簽證（如短期就業簽證或特定演藝人員工作許可），一般旅客免簽待遇並不能涵蓋商演活動。雖然大槻響在貼文中強調「明明已經取得了簽證」，但依照香港《入境條例》慣例，獲發入境簽證或許可並不等同保證必然可順利過關，入境處管制站人員在清關時，仍有權按當事人申報的訪港目的、活動性質及在港逗留細節進行獨立覆核與最後把關；若入境官員認為入境目的與申報資格不符，便可依法行使職權予以拒絕入境並安排即時遣返。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T04:24:06.590128+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":783,"images":20,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T04:09:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T04:37:26.251481+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T04:17:20.872620+00:00","content_hash":"fa570bf3380368272a9154df5bdfaa2e50b796b11c9ded21b3c04c4b13d6af85","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}